\subsection{Definitions and mathematical statement}
\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
For every unital inclusion $N\subseteq M$ of von Neumann algebras with separable preduals and a faithful normal conditional expectation $M\to N$, is there a unital injective subalgebra $P\subseteq N$ and a faithful normal conditional expectation $N\to P$ for which $P\prime \cap c(M)=N\prime \cap c(M)$, where c(M) is the continuous core?

\subsection{Short English statement}
For every unital inclusion $N\subseteq M$ of von Neumann algebras with separable preduals and a faithful normal conditional expectation $M\to N$, is there a unital injective subalgebra $P\subseteq N$ and a faithful normal conditional expectation $N\to P$ for which $P\prime \cap c(M)=N\prime \cap c(M)$, where c(M) is the continuous core?

\subsection{Sources}
